description	"Commander Wolffe 

An Airborne Commander with Jetboots and high synergy with mobile teammates.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Dual DC-17 Hand Blasters (3)
-- Cannot Be Disarmed
-- Knockback On Hit
-- 35% More Damage/FP Mult
-- 10% Less RoF
-- 50% Less Velocity
- Pulse Grenade (2)
- Cryo Grenade (2)

^5Powers:
- Cybernetic Optic (Sense 3)

^8Attributes:
- 25% Faster Hack Speed
- Healing (1)
- Blast Armor
- Environmental Protection (1)
- Slow Faller
- Grapple Hop
- Dexterity (2)
- Jet Boots (Jetpack)
- Rally
- Constant Survey (Miraluka Vision)
- Empathy (Stat Viewer)

^3Abilities:
- Quickthrow (1) ^3[CS2]
- Dodge ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS3]
- Gunkick ^3[CS4]
- Grappling Hook (2) ^3[Melee CS4]
- Health Dispenser (1) ^3[USE In Melee]"